The following script file evaluates the single-sided fast Fourier transform (FFT)
with frequency plotted on the horizontal axis.
dt  0.001;
tmax  2.0;
t  0:dt:tmax;
A  2*sin(2*pi*150.0*t)  5*sin(2*pi*333.0*t);
y  fft(A);
fmax  1/(2.0*dt);
f  linspace(0,fmax,length(t)/2);
m  abs(y)/length(f);
m  m(1:length(f));
plot(f,m)
xlabel('frequency')
ylabel('abs(FFT)')
